---
id: "kinds"
---

The component shapes the examples lack, for the instance-box tests (ADR 0018
§2). Each puts a use's outer box on a different node: Chip lays itself out,
so the box is the instance's own node; Tag only wraps one laid-out frame, so
the box is that frame; Badge's authored variants each wrap one frame, so the
box is the chosen variant's frame. None has a styles table, so none derives
a variant set.

## Visual Contract

<Page>
  <Component name="Chip" status="draft"
    layoutMode="HORIZONTAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
    counterAxisAlignItems="CENTER" itemSpacing={4}
    paddingLeft={8} paddingRight={8} paddingTop={4} paddingBottom={4}
    cornerRadius={6} fills="{surface#raised}">
    <Vector name="dot" width={6} height={6} fills="{surface#accent}"
      vectorPaths={[{ windingRule: 'NONZERO', data: 'M3 0 L6 3 L3 6 L0 3 Z' }]} />
    <Text name="label" characters="{label}" fontSize={12} fontWeight="MEDIUM" />
  </Component>
  <Component name="Tag" status="draft">
    <Frame name="box" layoutMode="HORIZONTAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
      paddingLeft={6} paddingRight={6} paddingTop={2} paddingBottom={2} cornerRadius={4}
      fills="{surface#raised}" strokes="{border#default}" strokeWeight={1}>
      <Text name="label" characters="{label}" fontSize={12} fills="{text#muted}" />
    </Frame>
  </Component>
  <Component name="Badge" status="draft" variants={{ tone: ['info', 'warn'] }}>
    <Variant tone="info">
      <Frame name="badge" layoutMode="HORIZONTAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
        paddingLeft={8} paddingRight={8} paddingTop={2} paddingBottom={2}
        topLeftRadius={8} bottomRightRadius={8} fills="{surface#accent}"
        strokes="{border#focus}" strokeBottomWeight={2}>
        <Text name="label" characters="Info" fontSize={12} fills="{text#onAccent}" />
      </Frame>
    </Variant>
    <Variant tone="warn">
      <Frame name="badge" layoutMode="HORIZONTAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
        paddingLeft={8} paddingRight={8} paddingTop={2} paddingBottom={2}
        topLeftRadius={8} bottomRightRadius={8} fills="{surface#danger}"
        strokes="{border#default}" strokeBottomWeight={2}>
        <Text name="label" characters="Warn" fontSize={12} fills="{text#onAccent}" />
      </Frame>
    </Variant>
  </Component>
</Page>

## Contract

<Props>
  <Prop name="label" type="string" sample="Label">The words it shows.</Prop>
</Props>
